<div class="realmusic-head"><span class="rm-tag">Hear it do structural work</span><span class="rm-work">Schoenberg · <em>Farben</em> — measures 12–17</span></div>
<p class="rm-intro">A recurring orchestral field continues while a distinct rising line emerges in the harp and is later echoed by piccolo and celesta. The change of instrumental identity is an event in its own right. Across <em>Farben</em>, gradual changes in the orchestration of a connected chordal field become a principal means of development and formal motion.</p>
